{
  "_comment": "Vegeta's own specials, by hand; npm run rom -- states --fighter vegeta merges them into states.json (src/rom/specials.ts). big_bang is move ad, the Big Bang shot upward (owner, 2026-10-31): on the ground, 10 health, its parts mad / mad_2 / mad_3. The flash at the hands (vegeta_flash, mad_2's first frame) is not put out yet. final_flash is move ac (docs/rom.md, Final Flash): 10 health, A held charges — let go before frame 20 the small beam, before 32 the medium, else the large (field f0, $20:9A82); the ball grows 2 a frame from 16 at 24, -46. mac_2 fires head, base and band (size 16 / 12 / 8, never thicker); then move b5 holds the pose, the band still drawn, until the head is gone and 24 / 20 / 16 frames more (jumps to 72 / 76 / 80 of 96). As for Goku's Kamehameha, the charge fires as it decides (the original shows 2 more frames, a jump to frame 42) and the head outlives its thrower's move. sliding_kick is move a4, Sliding Kick, ↓ ↘ → B on the ground; typed again from frame 8 to its end, it is kept and a5 (rushing_knee) follows when a4 is over, and the same from a5 (from frame 1) to a6 (cross_punch, cross_punch_2) — field f0, $20:97c7 / $20:9885. Nothing else is read meanwhile; a miss goes on too. knee_slash is move 9c, Jumping Knee Slash, → ↓ ↘ B on the ground ($20:92DF): at frame 6 vx 1, vy -8 at his own gravity; vx 0 at 24; from 30 it holds frame 31's pose until it lands, then 0c and m9c_4; every blow of it lifts a body into the high knockdown at -6.0, not -7.5 ($0D:D3BF). attack_b and crouch_b are his own handlers ($20:9280, $20:92C9): the far B slides at vx 3 from frame 6 to 24; the crouching B has a second blow, m95_2, re-armed at its start. driving_elbow is move a2, R + Y ($20:9739), as Goku's Side Slash: behind the opponent through step 0, on frame 24 turns and closes on him by a 32nd of the way to 8 px short. ground_flare is a9, ↓ ↑ Y, also from a jump's first 2 frames, still on the floor: its shot stands 48 px ahead. energy_field is ab, ↓ ↙ ← Y in the air: he stops at frame 1 and hangs (gravity off `?`), puts out the field at 0, -40 with sound 19 every 3 ticks for 25 (its object's code, $0F:BBAC — ours this state's loopSound), falls from vy 2 at his own gravity from frame 36 (the owner: slower than the original without it) and holds frame 47's pose until he lands ($20:9A09). renzoku is aa, ↓ ↘ → A, 5 health: three shots, one a part; its entry goes after Big Bang's, whose roll ends in the same ↓ ↘ → A.",
